# Magic Patterns UI (always)

Always follow the Magic Patterns components and designs, ported to React. Never hand-roll a lookalike UI kit.

Pair this with visual-first UX (`.cursor/rules/ux-design-thinking.mdc` + `DESIGN.md`): brand fit, personality, simplicity, no redundant copy. Components alone are not enough if the flow still feels generic or cluttered.
